{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">香港小姐2026｜<span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>《2026香港小姐競選決賽》日前圓滿結束，袁絲珩（Bernice）勇奪冠軍，鄧匡閔（Ada）奪亞軍，李澤欣（Scarlett）獲雙料季軍。2021年港姐冠軍宋宛穎（Sabrina）在社交平台晒出一輯靚相，留言勉勵一眾師妹。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"33971e61-558d-4578-80ca-965b31e35b4f.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026BuJAswVTNy1788255258.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"33971e61-558d-4578-80ca-965b31e35b4f.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_b90ea2ca9afda866-899\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>今年重返港姐舞台，Sabrina以《魔音女團》MYNT隊長的新身分，帶領成員表演新歌《Turn My Magic On》！她表示：「又一年香港小姐競選，轉眼已是我參與的第五年。今年對我而言格外特別，意義深重。重返這片當年參選的舞台，這次不再是師姐，亦不是主持，而是以表演嘉賓的身份站上這裡。」她送上真誠祝願：「見證新一屆佳麗閃亮登場，衷心祝願各位女孩，都能追尋屬於自己的光芒，奔赴各自精彩的人生！」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_b90ea2ca9afda866-899\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_b90ea2ca9afda866-899\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"927fdbae-2412-4589-aaf1-302540c708fe.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026oGxC2kKzjM1788255258.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"927fdbae-2412-4589-aaf1-302540c708fe.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"559936d7-0203-4537-9a9b-82650e072735.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/202605dmf5urLI1788255258.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"559936d7-0203-4537-9a9b-82650e072735.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_b90ea2ca9afda866-899\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_b90ea2ca9afda866-900\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>當晚Sabrina身穿一襲優雅的閃鑽銀色晚裝亮相紅地氈，貼身剪裁勾勒出其完美比例，弗爆身形表露無遺。她將紗裙執起，精緻美麗的五官在夢幻紗裙後呈現出一股朦朧美，彷如油畫中的人走進現實。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T10:00:09.240861+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":413,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}